{"seq":3,"slug":"measure-aggregation-additivity-derived-metric","title":"度量聚合、可加性分类与派生指标的定义语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/semantic-layer-motivation-model/measure-aggregation-additivity-derived-metric","wordCount":2831,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"度量聚合-可加性分类与派生指标的定义语义\">度量聚合、可加性分类与派生指标的定义语义</h1><p>某跨境电商团队的两张报表对不上：运营日报写「昨日退款率 3.1%」，财务月报写「本月退款率 4.7%」，而两边底层数据来自同一张订单表，同一天的退款笔数与支付笔数也完全一致。问题不在数据，在口径——日报把七天各自的退款率做了算术平均，月报把 30 天的退款笔数相加、支付笔数相加再相除。两个值只有当每天退款率恰好相等时才相同。<strong>一个指标的语义不只是「它怎么算出来」，还包括「它在什么粒度上可以怎么合并」</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-度量与聚合\">核心概念：度量与聚合</h2><p><strong>度量（measure）</strong> 是建模在最细粒度事实/事件上的可聚合表达式，例如「订单表 <code>paid_amount</code> 字段的 <code>sum</code>」；<strong>聚合函数（aggregation type）</strong> 决定字段如何归约，例如 <code>sum</code>、<code>count</code>、<code>average</code>；<strong>指标（metric）</strong> 是面向消费者的命名口径，既可以是一次聚合（简单指标），也可以是多个度量的组合（比率、表达式、累计）。dbt Semantic Layer 的 MetricFlow 把 measure 定义为「输入到 metric 的聚合」，其支持的聚合类型含 <code>sum</code>、<code>min</code>、<code>max</code>、<code>count_distinct</code>、<code>average</code>、<code>median</code>、<code>percentile</code>、<code>sum_boolean</code>（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/measures\">dbt measures</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[事实表行&lt;br/&gt;paid_amount, refund_amount, order_id] --&gt; B[measure:&lt;br/&gt;sum paid_amount]&#10;    A --&gt; C[measure:&lt;br/&gt;sum refund_amount]&#10;    A --&gt; D[measure:&lt;br/&gt;count_distinct order_id]&#10;    B --&gt; E[简单指标 GMV]&#10;    B --&gt; G[比率指标 AOV&lt;br/&gt;= GMV / 订单数]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; H[比率指标 退款率&lt;br/&gt;= 退款金额 / GMV]&#10;    B --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I[派生指标&lt;br/&gt;AOV 环比]&#10;    E --&gt; J[消费者&lt;br/&gt;BI / Notebook / AI Agent]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[事实表行&lt;br/&gt;paid_amount, refund_amount, order_id] --&gt; B[measure:&lt;br/&gt;sum paid_amount]\n    A --&gt; C[measure:&lt;br/&gt;sum refund_amount]\n    A --&gt; D[measure:&lt;br/&gt;count_distinct order_id]\n    B --&gt; E[简单指标 GMV]\n    B --&gt; G[比率指标 AOV&lt;br/&gt;= GMV / 订单数]\n    D --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; H[比率指标 退款率&lt;br/&gt;= 退款金额 / GMV]\n    B --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I[派生指标&lt;br/&gt;AOV 环比]\n    E --&gt; J[消费者&lt;br/&gt;BI / Notebook / AI Agent]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>三层责任不同：度量绑定物理模型（哪张表、哪个字段、哪个聚合函数），指标承载业务口径（负责人、单位、同义词、可加性声明），可加性则是<strong>度量与指标共有</strong>的属性，决定下游能否对结果再聚合。Kimball 的定义是：对所有维度都能求和即可加，只能部分维度求和即半可加，完全不能求和即不可加（Ralph Kimball, <em>The Data Warehouse Toolkit</em>）。这三层落到语义模型的方式，见同章的 <a href=\"semantic-model-metric-dimension-grain\">语义模型：指标、维度、粒度与业务对象的建模</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>谁定义</th>\n<th>变更影响面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>measure</td>\n<td><code>paid_amount</code> → <code>sum</code></td>\n<td>数据建模者，绑定物理列</td>\n<td>换表 / 换字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简单指标</td>\n<td><code>GMV = sum(paid_amount)</code></td>\n<td>业务口径 owner</td>\n<td>口径含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生指标</td>\n<td><code>退款率 = 退款金额 / GMV</code></td>\n<td>业务口径 owner</td>\n<td>依赖的分子分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可加性声明</td>\n<td>GMV 可加、库存半可加、退款率不可加</td>\n<td>建模者与 owner 共同确认</td>\n<td>预聚合 / 缓存能否上卷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可加性三分类及其判定\">可加性三分类及其判定</h2><p>判定一个度量的可加性，问的是同一句话：<strong>把它按维度 A 拆成若干子集、分别计算、再相加，结果是否等于不拆分直接计算的值？</strong> 对所有维度都成立 → 可加；对某些维度成立但时间维度不成立 → 半可加；对任何维度都不成立 → 不可加。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>跨境电商典型度量</th>\n<th>预聚合策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可加 additive</td>\n<td>对所有维度求和都成立</td>\n<td>GMV、支付订单数、退款笔数、加购次数</td>\n<td>可物化到任意粒度，再上卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半可加 semi-additive</td>\n<td>跨时间不可求和，跨其他维度可以</td>\n<td>期末库存、账户余额、在架 SKU 数</td>\n<td>只物化到非时间维度；时间上取期末值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可加 non-additive</td>\n<td>任何维度求和都会失真</td>\n<td>退款率、客单价 AOV、转化率、去重买家数</td>\n<td>先物化分子与分母两个可加度量，查询时现算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>半可加最容易被忽略。库存快照在「按仓库」「按 SKU」维度上求和有意义（各仓库存相加即总库存），但把周一到周日七天的库存相加毫无意义——跨时间的正确聚合是取区间末值。因此语义层必须能表达「时间粒度上的聚合是 <code>last</code> 而非 <code>sum</code>」，这正是快照类事实（snapshot fact）存在的理由。</p>\n<p>不可加度量要求把「呈现量」与「计算量」拆开：对外暴露 <code>退款率</code>，内部物化的必须是 <code>refund_amount</code> 与 <code>paid_amount</code> 两个可加 measure，比率在查询时按目标粒度重算。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 天退款金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、支付金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>退款率</mtext><mtext>正确</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>退款率</mtext><mtext>错误</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{退款率}_{\\text{正确}} = \\frac{\\sum_{d \\in D} R_d}{\\sum_{d \\in D} P_d}, \\qquad \\text{退款率}_{\\text{错误}} = \\frac{1}{|D|}\\sum_{d \\in D} \\frac{R_d}{P_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退款率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">正确</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4802em;vertical-align:-1.0131em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0131em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退款率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">错误</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6898em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两者只有在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_d}{P_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3451em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相等时才相等；现实中退款率随大促、季节与品类结构波动，二者常相差 20% 以上，这正是报表对不上的原因。</p>\n<p>去重计数（<code>count_distinct</code>）是另一类不可加，且连「先物化可加分量」这条路都没有：买家两天各下单一次，两天去重计数之和为 2，跨两天却为 1。可行做法是物化「首次出现」辅助度量，或在高基数近似场景用可合并的 HyperLogLog sketch 承受误差，并标注该指标「必须回源重算」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合函数的语义边界\">聚合函数的语义边界</h2><p>聚合函数本身也各带语义约束。<code>sum</code> 与 <code>count</code> 天然可加；<code>min</code>/<code>max</code> 是<strong>可合并但不可加</strong>的（两分区的 min 取 min 得全局 min）；<code>average</code> 不可加，因为它等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sum</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>count</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sum}/\\text{count}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span></span></span></span></span>，必须同时携带 sum 与 count；<code>count_distinct</code> 近似不可加（HLL sketch 可合并但带误差）；<code>median</code>、<code>percentile</code> 需要 t-digest / GK 这类可合并近似结构，精确中位数无法由子集中位数合并得到。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合函数</th>\n<th>跨分区可合并</th>\n<th>可加（结果可再求和）</th>\n<th>合并所需携带状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sum</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单个数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>count</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单个计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min</code> / <code>max</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>单个极值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>average</code></td>\n<td>是（需配套）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>sum + count</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>count_distinct</code></td>\n<td>近似（HLL）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>sketch 或明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>median</code> / <code>percentile</code></td>\n<td>近似（t-digest）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>分位草图或明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>first</code> / <code>last</code>（按时间）</td>\n<td>是（需有序）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>时间序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了一件事：<strong>「可上卷」和「可加」不是一回事</strong>。编译查询时先看聚合类型属于哪一类，再决定预聚合层能否复用、缓存能否跨粒度命中。把 <code>average</code> 当 <code>sum</code> 一样直接物化再平均，是最高频的一类缺陷——设分区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、样本数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，全局均值必须是加权的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} = \\sum_i n_i \\bar{x}_i / \\sum_i n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，直接算术平均会忽略各分区订单量差异。凡以「平均」「比率」出现的指标，都应建模为分子分母两个 measure。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派生指标的定义语义\">派生指标的定义语义</h2><p>派生指标是在其他指标之上再做一次运算的指标。MetricFlow 把它拆成明确类型：<code>ratio</code>（分子除以分母）、<code>derived</code>（多 metric 表达式运算）、<code>cumulative</code>（时间窗内累加）、<code>conversion</code>（分母事件后发生分子事件）、<code>simple</code>（单次聚合）（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/metrics-overview\">dbt metrics overview</a>）。类型化而非自由表达式，是为了让编译层知道<strong>哪些运算可以下推、哪些必须先对齐粒度</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>比率（ratio）</strong> 最容易出错的是分子分母的粒度对齐：两者必须来自<strong>同一聚合粒度</strong>，分子按订单、分母按会话，或分子按 UTC 日切、分母按本地日切，结果都会随粒度漂移。因此契约必须写明分子 measure、分母 measure 与共享过滤条件。</p>\n<p><strong>表达式（derived）</strong> 用于 <code>毛利 = 收入 - 成本</code> 这类运算，陷阱在于对不可加分量运算后结果同样不可加：<code>毛利</code> 两分量都可加故可加，而 <code>毛利率 = 毛利 / GMV</code> 又退回不可加。语义层应能从表达式树<strong>推导结果的 additivity</strong>——全可加分量间加减 → 可加；出现除法或涉及非可加分量 → 不可加；这是预聚合决策的输入，不是可选项。</p>\n<p><strong>累计量（cumulative）</strong> 把「时间窗内累加」编码进定义，例如「过去 7 天滚动 GMV」。难点在窗口边界：滚动窗对齐点、月度累计的月初重启、跨时区「月」的切分都必须固定在定义里，而非交给消费端解释。MetricFlow 的 <code>window</code> 字段正是为表达「累积 / 滚动 / 偏移」语义而设计（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/cumulative-metrics\">dbt cumulative metrics</a>）。</p>\n<p>三者共享一条不变量：<strong>派生指标的粒度只能等于或粗于其分量的粒度</strong>。无法在按天的表上凭空算出「按小时的转化率」，因为分母在小时粒度上不存在；编译时应直接拒绝这类查询，而不是返回一个悄悄错掉的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商口径陷阱-多币种-时区与快照\">跨境电商口径陷阱：多币种、时区与快照</h2><p>跨境场景的「同名不同值」几乎都出在这三处。</p>\n<p><strong>多币种。</strong> 结算货币（USD）与本地货币（JPY、BRL 等）混在同一张订单表时，求和与换算的先后顺序会改变结果。逐笔换算后求和与先求和再乘单一汇率，只在所有币种汇率相同时才相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>逐笔</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>混合</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GMV_{\\text{逐笔}} = \\sum_{i} \\sum_{c} L_{i,c}\\, r_{c,t}, \\qquad GMV_{\\text{混合}} = \\Big(\\sum_i \\sum_c L_{i,c}\\Big)\\,\\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">逐笔</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">混合</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>订单覆盖多币种而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是混合汇率时，两者之差来自各币种权重与汇率差异。因此必须把「汇率逐笔绑定在事实行、还是查询时统一换算」写进<strong>度量定义</strong>，并让所有派生指标继承同一约定。</p>\n<p><strong>时区。</strong> 订单时间戳通常以 UTC 存储。若「自然日 GMV」按 UTC 切分，中国区（东八区）用户在本地 8:00 前下的单会被算进前一天的日 GMV，巴西（UTC-3）用户则相反。这不是技术 bug 而是口径选择；同一指标若在不同消费端用不同时区切分就会产生两套「日 GMV」。做法是把时区固定进<strong>指标定义</strong>，让所有时间派生量继承它。</p>\n<p><strong>快照与半可加。</strong> 库存、在架 SKU 数、会员余额都是快照类度量，跨时间只能取期末值。若建模成普通 <code>sum</code>，「本月总库存」会得到七天库存之和的荒谬数字，而错误往往到月末对账才暴露。跨境场景还多一层：多仓库存（本地仓、海外仓、FBA）跨仓库可加、跨时间不可加，正好落在半可加定义里。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>语义层控制点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多币种换算顺序</td>\n<td>同一 GMV 两处差 0.x%</td>\n<td>汇率绑定在事实行 vs 查询时换算，写进度量定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度时区不一致</td>\n<td>日 GMV 与月 GMV 对不上</td>\n<td>时区作为指标定义的一部分，派生量继承</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半可加当可加</td>\n<td>「本月库存」= 日库存之和</td>\n<td>快照事实 + 时间聚合取 <code>last</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比率被平均</td>\n<td>退款率 / 转化率随粒度漂移</td>\n<td>建模为分子分母两个可加度量，查询时重算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语义层把「度量 → 聚合函数 → 指标」分为三层；可加性是<strong>度量与指标共有的属性</strong>，决定下游能否再聚合，必须显式声明而非靠约定。</li>\n<li>可加性三分类的判据只有一句：按维度拆开算再相加，是否等于不拆直接算。全维度成立 → 可加；仅时间不成立 → 半可加；任何维度都不成立 → 不可加。</li>\n<li>「可上卷」不等于「可加」：<code>min</code>/<code>max</code> 可合并但结果不能求和；<code>average</code> 需携带 sum+count 状态；<code>count_distinct</code>、<code>median</code> 只能近似合并；把 <code>average</code> 当 <code>sum</code> 物化是最高频的实现缺陷。</li>\n<li>比率、表达式、累计三类派生指标的核心约束是<strong>粒度对齐</strong>与<strong>分量可加性推导</strong>；凡以「平均 / 比率」出现的指标都应建模为分子分母两个可加度量，查询时按目标粒度重算。</li>\n<li>跨境报表对不上绝大多数落在币种换算顺序、时区切分、快照半可加三处；把这三件事写进度量与指标定义，是把「口径」从口头约定变成可编译契约的唯一方式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"度量聚合、可加性分类与派生指标的定义语义","id":"度量聚合-可加性分类与派生指标的定义语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：度量与聚合","id":"核心概念-度量与聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"可加性三分类及其判定","id":"可加性三分类及其判定"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合函数的语义边界","id":"聚合函数的语义边界"},{"level":2,"text":"派生指标的定义语义","id":"派生指标的定义语义"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商口径陷阱：多币种、时区与快照","id":"跨境电商口径陷阱-多币种-时区与快照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语义模型：指标、维度、粒度与业务对象的建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/semantic-layer-motivation-model/semantic-model-metric-dimension-grain"},"next":{"title":"语义图：实体关系、join 路径与一致性维度的建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/metrics-semantic-layer-headless-bi-metrics-store/semantic-graph-metrics-catalog/semantic-graph-entity-join-path"}}